    - target: {fileID: 7500671343821934536, guid: 53222a3d044d047ecaef21b5dfea0742, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Speed: 2          Agility: 2          Durability: 3          Stability:
        4

        Saturn is the 6th and least dense planet from the Sun - it''s
        in fact less dense than water. It has 146 moons, the most in the Solar System,
        and its famous rings are mostly made of chunks of ice and rock.

        Ability:
        Saturn''s rings push surrounding objects laterally. Hold down ability key
        to rotate rings.

        Activation: 20s          Cooldown: 20s'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
