        2

        Venus is the 2nd planet from the Sun. Its dense atmosphere traps
        greenhouse gases, making it the hottest and deadliest planet.

        Ability:
        Venus uses its toxic atmosphere to shield itself from asteroids. No effect
        on drones.

        Activation: 20s          Cooldown: 20s'
